# Canonical contributor identities (owner ruling 2026-10-20).
#
# Commits in this repository were authored under several automation, agent and
# local-machine identities over the alpha line. They are all the owner's: the
# entries below map every non-bot identity to the canonical GitHub account so
# git tooling and GitHub attribution report one human contributor instead of
# unlinked aliases. Bot accounts (github-actions[bot], dependabot[bot], the
# Copilot Autofix bots) are intentionally NOT mapped: their commits stay
# attributed to the bots.
#
# Syntax: Proper Name <proper@email> Commit Name <commit@email>
